stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Start
    Start --> Identifier: letter or underscore
    Identifier --> Identifier: letter digit underscore
    Identifier --> AcceptIdentifier: delimiter lookahead
    Start --> Digit: digit
    Digit --> Digit: digit
    Digit --> Dot: dot
    Dot --> Digit: digit
    Digit --> AcceptInteger: delimiter
    Digit --> AcceptIPv4: fourth component validated
